{"ref":"BDB, עַד²","hw":"עַד²","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עַד</span></big>  and <span dir=\"rtl\">וָעֶ֑ד</span> (so always) <strong>n.m. perpetuity (</strong> = <em>advancing</em> time, cf. Assyrian <em>adû</em>, <em>time, at the present time</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  of <em>past time:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מִנִּי עַד</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:4\" href=\"/Job.20.4\">Jb 20:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הררי עד</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:6\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.6\">Hb 3:6</a> <em>ancient mountains</em> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עֵילָם²\" href=\"/BDB,_עֵילָם²\", dir=\"rtl\">עולם</a> <strong>1</strong>) so <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:26\" href=\"/Genesis.49.26\">Gn 49:26</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">הַרְרֵי עַד</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹרַ֔י עַד</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  of <em>future time</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לָעַד</span> (usually <span dir=\"rtl\">לָעַ֑ד</span>) <em>for ever:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  during lifetime, of king <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:7\" href=\"/Psalms.21.7\">ψ 21:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.14\">Pr 29:14</a>; of others <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:19\" href=\"/Psalms.9.19\">ψ 9:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:27\" href=\"/Psalms.22.27\">22:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 61:9\" href=\"/Psalms.61.9\">61:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.19\">Pr 12:19</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  of things, <span dir=\"rtl\">לָעַד בַּצּוּר יֵחָֽצֵב֑וּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 19:24\" href=\"/Job.19.24\">Jb 19:24</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  <em>of continuous existence</em>, of nations, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבֶרֶת עַד</span> (of Babylon, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עוֹלָם\" href=\"/BDB,_עוֹלָם\", dir=\"rtl\">עולם</a> <strong>2 c</strong>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 47:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.47.7\">Is 47:7</a> (yet v. iii. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עַד⁴\" href=\"/BDB,_עַד⁴\", dir=\"rtl\">עַד</a> <strong>II 3</strong>); anger, <span dir=\"rtl\">לעד</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:11\" href=\"/Amos.1.11\">Am 1:11</a>; elsewhere <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲדֵי עַד</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:18\" href=\"/Psalms.83.18\">ψ 83:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 92:8\" href=\"/Psalms.92.8\">92:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.4\">Is 26:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 65:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.65.18\">65:18</a>. <strong>d.</strong>  of divine existence, <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁכֵן עַד</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.15\">Is 57:15</a>; attributes, <span dir=\"rtl\">לָעַד</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 111:3\" href=\"/Psalms.111.3\">ψ 111:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 111:10\" href=\"/Psalms.111.10\">10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 112:3\" href=\"/Psalms.112.3\">112:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 112:9\" href=\"/Psalms.112.9\">9</a>; residence in Zion, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲדֵי עַד</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 132:14\" href=\"/Psalms.132.14\">132:14</a>; law of God, <span dir=\"rtl\">לָעַד</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 19:10\" href=\"/Psalms.19.10\">19:10</a>; promise as to dynasty of David, <span dir=\"rtl\">לָעַד</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:30\" href=\"/Psalms.89.30\">89:30</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲדֵי עַד</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 132:12\" href=\"/Psalms.132.12\">132:12</a>; inheritance of land, <span dir=\"rtl\">לָעַד</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:29\" href=\"/Psalms.37.29\">37:29</a>; continuous relations between God and his people <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.9\">1 Ch 28:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 64:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.64.8\">Is 64:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:18\" href=\"/Micah.7.18\">Mi 7:18</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">לעד</span>. <strong>e.</strong>  phrases (see <a data-ref=\"BDB, עול²\" href=\"/BDB,_עול²\", dir=\"rtl\">עולם</a> <strong>2 m</strong>): <span dir=\"rtl\">(לְ)עוֹלָם וָעֶ֑ד</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:6\" href=\"/Psalms.9.6\">ψ 9:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:16\" href=\"/Psalms.10.16\">10:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:5\" href=\"/Psalms.21.5\">21:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:7\" href=\"/Psalms.45.7\">45:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:18\" href=\"/Psalms.45.18\">18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 48:15\" href=\"/Psalms.48.15\">48:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 52:10\" href=\"/Psalms.52.10\">52:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:5\" href=\"/Psalms.104.5\">104:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:44\" href=\"/Psalms.119.44\">119:44</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 145:1\" href=\"/Psalms.145.1\">145:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 145:2\" href=\"/Psalms.145.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 145:21\" href=\"/Psalms.145.21\">21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:18\" href=\"/Exodus.15.18\">Ex 15:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:5\" href=\"/Micah.4.5\">Mi 4:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 12:3\" href=\"/Daniel.12.3\">Dn 12:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לָעַד לְעוֹלָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 111:8\" href=\"/Psalms.111.8\">ψ 111:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 148:6\" href=\"/Psalms.148.6\">148:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד־עוֹלְמֵי עַד</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.17\">Is 45:17</a>.—<a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.8\">Is 30:8</a> read <span dir=\"rtl\">(עַד־עוֹלָם) לְעֵד</span> <em>for a witness</em> (𝔖 𝔊 𝔗 Ges Ew Di Che Du) for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">לָעַד</span>.","next":"BDB, עַד³","prev":"BDB, עָדָה"}